      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense for the overview. To make the paper more rigorous, I need to look at the specific \"evidence\" they cite. Could you go into more detail about the specific mechanisms or studies they point to? Like, what are the actual arguments regarding how genetics might influence these IQ gaps? I want to understand the logic they use so I can critique it properly in my paper.",
